{"id": "723009b9f9180d4a460d4500", "session_id": "bbfc271873402726fd8c6279", "scenario_id": "retail", "title": "大促缺货与履约补救", "industry": "零售电商", "prompt": "查询订单和库存，列出SKU A缺口与已超24小时的订单，先给运营交接摘要。", "status": "completed", "created_at": 1795680215623, "turn": 1, "runtime_arn": "arn:aws:bedrock-agentcore:us-east-1:632930644527:runtime/decider_model_router_industry-Fg8vWeEOIs", "runtime_qualifier": "DEFAULT", "platform_version": "V2", "protocol_version": "native-stream-v1", "model": "model-router", "provider": "liquid", "dataset_version": "dae0d4382fc67060", "data_source": "synthetic_business_records", "routing_preferences": {"cost_tier": "medium", "benchmark_release": "auto", "input_tokens": null, "expected_output_tokens": 1024, "max_output_tokens": 16384, "min_success_rate": null, "max_latency_ms": null, "min_context_tokens": null, "max_reference_cost_usd": null, "allowed_models": null, "excluded_models": []}, "trimmed_turns": 0, "context_messages": 0, "context_bytes": 2, "max_model_calls": 6, "updated_at": 1795680233121, "runtime_session_id": "dmr-native-stream-v1-9fbe350b84aa218e4e26fdf60e69f0ac08f21bd8a11694b9a9ea8b2cf6711f28", "answer": "## 运营交接摘要\n\n**SKU A当前缺口15件；已迟发超过24小时的订单为O101、O103，按规则应补偿合计500元，待处理。** 以下为演示合成数据，未执行分货、发货、采购或补偿。\n\n### 1. SKU A库存与缺口\n依据库存记录 **inventory / A**、订单 **O101、O103**：\n- 需求：30＋20＝**50件**。\n- 当前可用：**35件**。\n- 当前缺口：50－35＝**15件**。\n- 在途：**20件**，记录到货周期为**48小时**；**在途不能视为已入库**。若全部按期入库且无新增占用，覆盖现有需求后可余5件。\n\n**建议分货顺序：**依规则，O101先于O103。建议先为O101分配30件，剩余5件分配给O103；O103尚缺15件。是否允许部分发货需确认。\n\n### 2. 已迟发超过24小时的订单\n\n按订单编号去重，筛选条件为 `late_hours > 24`：\n\n| 订单编号 | SKU | 数量（件） | 订单金额（元） | 迟发时长（小时） | 按规则补偿（元，待处理） |\n|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| O101 | A | 30 | 6,000 | 26 | 300 |\n| O103 | A | 20 | 4,000 | 30 | 200 |\n| **合计** | | **50** | **10,000** | — | **500** |\n\n补偿计算：单订单取“订单金额×5%”与“300元上限”中的较小值。  \n**O102**迟发4小时，不属于超过24小时的订单。\n\n### 3. 交接待办与限制\n- **仓配待办：**按上述顺序核实并分配库存，确认可发货时间及是否允许拆单发货。\n- **采购待办：**核实A在途20件的实际到货时间；未入库前不得承诺已可发货。\n- **客服待办：**为O101、O103准备补偿及延迟告知方案，补偿合计500元；具体发货承诺以仓配确认为准。\n- **信息缺口：**未提供老客标识、具体承诺日期及补偿处理状态，暂不能判断老客影响或认定补偿已完成。A的单位毛利记录为45元，但缺少拆单、加急等费用，暂不能核算处置后的净毛利。", "finished_at": 1795680233105, "steps": [{"step": 1, "run_id": "5f718a83bd74392ad1c751b7", "status": "completed", "provider": "liquid", "decision_model": "LiquidAI/d1-2B", "profile": {"workflow": "customer_support", "difficulty": "moderate", "stronger_model_benefit": "low", "latency": "normal", "tools": "no", "structured_output": "no", "languages": "zh"}, "model_id": "openai.gpt-oss-120b-1:0", "configuration_id": "141b2ee3d79b6b725f15c352", "previous_model_id": null, "previous_configuration_id": null, "model_changed": false, "configuration_changed": false, "stickiness": {"enabled": true, "retained": false, "previous_configuration_id": null, "reason": "本轮由决策模型重新选择。"}, "selection_reason": "GPU先判断需求，再根据评测证据选择；全部合格配置均已参与判断。", "model_decision_ms": 565.538, "model_decision_calls": 2, "decision_mode": "two_stage", "measurement_version": "c7321b98e520d9fbf69449df", "gpu_ms": 563.654, "assessment_ms": 112.045, "selection_ms": 453.493, "target_ms": 1494.007, "usage": {"inputTokens": 511, "outputTokens": 109, "totalTokens": 620}, "cache": {"enabled": true, "supported": false, "checkpoints": 0, "policy_version": "agent-native-cache-v1", "source": "https://docs.aws.amazon.com/bedrock/latest/userguide/prompt-caching.html", "observed": false, "read_tokens": 0, "write_tokens": 0, "total_input_tokens": 511, "note": "命中以 Bedrock cacheReadInputTokens 为准；inputTokens 不包含缓存读写。缓存费用未知时不估算折扣。"}, "output_budget": {"requested_max_tokens": 16384, "effective_max_tokens": 16384, "source": "exact_endpoint_parameter_probe", "note": "不超过请求上限；已核验的端点限制可能更低。"}, "provider_metadata_omitted": {"reasoningContent": 1}, "reference_cost_usd": "0.00014205", "stop_reason": "tool_use", "tool_call_count": 1}, {"step": 2, "run_id": "fac8707b679498406e0a4b66", "status": "completed", "provider": "liquid", "decision_model": "LiquidAI/d1-2B", "profile": {"workflow": "general_text", "difficulty